  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-05-03T03:06:03.992Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In the lastest open beta, the ability for physbones to squish as part of collision has been added. \n\nI would like to propose the ability for physbones to stretch as part of collision in exactly the same way as the new squish works.\n\nThis would probably be best implemented as a a checkbox that allows this feature to be toggled, (preferably with an identical toggle added to the existing squish behavior)",
